Wind Waker Randomizer (https://github.com/LagoLunatic/wwrando)
---------------------------------------------------------------
wwedit.py, wwgui.py and tools/wwcat.py include data taken from the Wind Waker Randomizer:
item names (data/item_names.txt), stage descriptions (data/stage_names.txt), sea square names
(data/island_names.txt), entrance spawn points (randomizers/entrances.py), and event flag notes
from its patches (asm/patches/*.asm).
