zeldaret/tww decompilation (https://github.com/zeldaret/tww)
-------------------------------------------------------------
Save layout, offsets, flag names and the behaviour this editor copies (item pickups, restart
places, spawn point lookup and so on) come from the decompilation, which is released under
CC0 1.0 Universal. No code from it is included; credit is given with thanks.

ZeldaSpeedRuns event flag spreadsheet
-------------------------------------
Story flag descriptions come from the community spreadsheet linked from
https://www.zeldaspeedruns.com/tww/general-knowledge/flags-and-triggers. It is not included in
this repository: the editor downloads it at runtime and keeps a local copy.

BlueWake (https://github.com/chrissotraidis/bluewake)
------------------------------------------------------
Opening and writing memory cards uses BlueWake's own tools: scripts/card_to_gci.py, run from
your BlueWake checkout, and a save injector you build from tests/dolphin_save_import_cli.c and
apple/ios/src/dolphin_save_import.c. Neither is included here. BlueWake is GPLv3.
